! mcp_bootstrap_p382.strap -- MCP printed page 382: the $EOJ package
! (PUNID 22$EOJ, card series ZA): the job-card path into UNCODE, the
! 6-bit to 8-bit conversion of the job card (YJCLP loop), the $SPU and
! D TIME calls, and the IQS-to-A8 time and date set-up for the spool
! message.  Lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.132, read at 400 dpi, names at 900
! dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$EOJ  CARD ID
! ZA000055  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 382"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 020031, line 1's word.
!
! >>> NOT SCOMD. <<<  PUNID 22$EOJ, card series ZA, origin 020031.40.
! This page is not the start of the package (card ZA000055); pp.378-381
! carry the earlier cards and are not landed, hence the hard SLC.
! No TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, every line number prints a "*"; a "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 15, 36 and 54.  Contiguous 020031.40 .. 020072.00
! (line 56, a half word; next 020072.40).  Every line compiles.
!   lines  1-5   ,SSCR4 / ,YBCBU / B,WSYSCA+.32 / LVI,$14,YUCO1 / B,YUNCOD
!   line   6     YUCO1 XW,0 (whole word)
!   lines  7-14  VF,1.0 / ,YBCBU / ,YJCDB1 / B,WSYSC2 / BB,SYSMOD /
!                SIC,WREJRT / B,WREJJB / CM1111,SJBUSY
!   lines 15-22  6-bit to 8-bit job-card loop YJCLP (LF/SF/CB+)
!   lines 23-27  BD,SA6IQS calling sequence (VF/CF/VF)
!   lines 28-42  SIC/B ZSPLPR, B,DMCP ($SPU, 67.0) and B,DMCP (D TIME,
!                D COMM)
!   lines 43-56  SIQSA8 sequence, date/time moves, SIC/B ZSPLPR.
!
! JOIN.  p.381 not landed; line 1 at 020031.40 is the heading row's
! word.  p.383 should open at 020072.40.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 4/6 "YUCO1": at 900 dpi the glyph after C is the squared,
!     closed box this drum prints for letter O (compare NOP on line 21),
!     not the narrow open oval of the digit 0 ("XW,0" in the same row);
!     and the comment is "-TO UNCODE".  Spelled YUCO1.
!   * line 11 "SYSMCD" = SYSMOD (landed p.103); "$+2.0".
!   * line 12 "SIC,W RLJ RT" = WREJRT (landed p.268 line 49
!     "WREJRT SYN,YTRT+.32" = 020376.00, the printed address); the E
!     prints worn as L.
!   * line 24 "BD,SA6IQS" (Vision read SAGIGS): SA6IQS, landed p.260;
!     230567.44 = 230567.40 + BD.
!   * lines 37/38/41 "D MCP", "D TIME", "DCCMM" = DMCP, DTIME, DCOMM
!     (landed pp.105/108).
!   * line 36 ",1.C" = 1.0; line 6 "XW,C" = XW,0; octal fields printed
!     "CC0000", "CCCC1C" are zeros.
!   * line 53 "STCDAY" = STODAY (landed p.103).
!   * hex bytes "C0"/"0C" on B rows (lines 5, 13, 29, 55) = 00 (lesson 6).
!
! EXTERNALS whose value comes only from this page's binary (no page
! defines them): WSYSCA (B line 3 WSYSCA+.32 = 020412.10, half word
! only), WSYSC2, WREJJB, WSPLL, YYJCL, YC4CM, YC4CM1, YC4CM2, YC4TIM,
! YC4DTI, YC4DTE, YC4DTS (plain SYN, lesson 8).  YJCDB1 and YJCDBU copy
! the existing stand-ins (p.180, p.366), which this page's binary agrees
! with.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  ZA000055 .. ZA000106.  Lines 12-13 share ZA000066 and
! lines 33-36 share ZA000086 (B,DMCP / ,67.0 / ,YBCBU / ,1.0 -- one
! calling sequence).  Recorded.

